dana, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;문체부 돋음체&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\">)</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: &quot;문체부 돋음체&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;문체부 돋음체&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -51.06px; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -51.06px; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">※ (첨부파일) '도서관글판 문안공모 응모 신청서(학부생외-이메일용)' 제출</span></u></font></span></span></span></span><u></u></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"></p><p><strong><strong><u><font face=\"문체부 돋음체\"><br></font></u></strong></strong></p><p><strong><strong><u><font face=\"문체부 돋음체\"><br></font></u></strong></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">시상내역</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">당선작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">) 10</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">만원 상당 생협상품권</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">후보작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(5</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명 이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">) 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">만원 상당 생협상품권</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">유의 사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36.7pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -36.7pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">응모 문안이 같은 경우 먼저 접수된 것만 인정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">유사 문안 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36.7pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -36.7pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">인의 응모작 수는&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">개까지 가능</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">응모자 중복 시상 없음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 28.3pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -28.3pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수상 작품 중 창작 문안에 대한 저작권은 응모자에게 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 28.3pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -28.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">저작재산권에 대한 우선협상권은 금오공과대학교 도서관에 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36.7pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -36.7pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">원작자 사용동의 절차 과정 중 제출된 문안의 수정이 있을 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36.7pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -36.7pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">문안 심사 제외 대상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36.7pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -36.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">문학작품 등의 발췌 문안임에도 불구하고 출처를 명기하지 않은 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">본교 도서관 글판 당선작으로 선정되었던 문안</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 28pt; line-height: 19.2px; text-indent: -28pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">타 기관 운영 유사 글판 선정 문안은 채택되지 않을 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36.7pt; text-indent: -36.7pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">◦&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">당선작이 없을 경우 도서관 자체 선정하여 게시함&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 36.7pt; text-indent: -36.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">게시장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">도서관 건물 정면 외벽</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">게시기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: 2021. 12. ~ 2022. 2.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -38.3pt; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;[3</span><span style=\"text-indent: -38.3pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">개월간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -38.3pt; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">결과발표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">: 2021. 11. 22.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">개별연락 및 도서관 홈페이지 공지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">도서관&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">층 연속간행물실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(478-7170)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 4pt; margin-left: 38.3pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 8px; text-indent: -38.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span styl